# Git remotes

- Push and open PRs only on `spark` → `glitch-spark/engineers_app`.
- Never `git push`, force-push, or `gh pr create` against `bcano-office` / `origin` when origin is bcano.
- Treat `origin` / `bcano-office` as read-only (fetch/compare only).
- Default for this machine: `spark` remote. Base branch is usually `main`.
